      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antlers%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The historic Caddo Indians, descendants of the Mississippians, once claimed the Antlers area as part of their large territory.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antlers%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Frisco Railroad served as the chief form of transportation through the region until freight operations closed in 1981.",
